---
layout: base.njk
title: null
---
<section class="hero">
  <span class="hero-eyebrow">Product · Supply Chain Risk · Learning in public</span>
  <h1>Phil Venice</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Product manager working at the intersection of supply chain risk management and
    Pentagon-facing programs. Formerly 11 years at Boeing in third-party risk &amp; resilience.
    This is a small home for what I'm building, learning, and thinking about.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/about/">About &amp; background</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/blog/">Read the notes</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <p class="section-label">Recent notes</p>
  <div class="note-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <a class="note-item" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <div class="note-item-top">
        <span class="note-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="note-date">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
      {% if post.data.tags %}
      <div class="note-tags">
        {% for tag in post.data.tags %}<span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </a>
    {% else %}
    <a class="note-item" href="/blog/">
      <div class="note-item-top">
        <span class="note-title">Nothing posted yet — first notes coming soon</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note-excerpt">I'm setting this up before I start writing. Check back soon, or see the blog page for what's planned.</p>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
